        "position": "Manager",
        "startDate": "2020-05",
        "summary": "Manager serving as a technical lead and lead developer for a tax-integration platform, with responsibilities spanning integration development, project coordination, client support, troubleshooting, implementation assistance, and documentation.",
        "highlights": [
          "Served as Lead Developer and Project Manager.",
          "Managed internal development projects and client-coordinated work, sharing integration updates, reporting status, and responding to questions and requests.",
          "Supported end-to-end integration implementations, including requirements gathering, setup, troubleshooting, and go-live support.",
          "Develop integrations between financial platforms and tax providers.",
          "Supported integrations with Acumatica, Chargebee, Sage Intacct, WooCommerce, Magento/Adobe Commerce, Thomson Reuters, Vertex, Sovos, and SureTax.",
          "Led the transition from Version 1 to Version 2 of the tax-integration platform.",
          "Broadened tax-provider and financial-platform support.",
          "Improved UI/UX.",
          "Optimized asynchronous operations to improve performance and throughput.",
          "Migrated production workloads from DigitalOcean to AWS.",
          "Created and maintained client guides and knowledge-base articles.",
          "Developed integrations between financial platforms and tax providers, including Acumatica, Chargebee, Sage Intacct, WooCommerce, Magento/Adobe Commerce, Thomson Reuters, Vertex, Sovos, and SureTax.",
          "Led the transition from Version 1 to Version 2 of the tax-integration platform, broadening tax-provider and financial-platform support and improving UI/UX."
        ]
